I'd give my left hand to be ambidextrous, but since that ain't going
to happen, what are the other alternatives?

Spork makes two-weapon a little more difficult, but overall the
changes favor rogues, who can be sac-gifted Magicbane.  (They still
shouldn't bother with two-weapon as Magicbane plus d30 is nice
enough.)

You can carry both a weapon and a shield on the off arm.  In Sporkhack
you can thereby get light, free action or reflection plus a stat
boost.  (What does it say about old dreadlocks that she's everybody's
plan-B for reflection?  Pity the boots are essentially useless.)

Shield plus off-hand weapon is especially attractive for Monks.
(Strange, very strange, but true.)

Overall thrown weapons have a big advantage over fired weapons that
they never require a free hand to toss them.

